# Internal docs and working material live in the repo but are not part of
# the site. Without these the build-step-free deploy serves them at their
# own URLs. The trailing ! is required: a rule whose path matches a real
# file is shadowed by that file unless the status is forced.
# screenshots, attached_assets, undefined and the bare .md catch-all were
# added 2026-11-18 during the IP review; the rest already existed.
/TODO.md            /404.html  404!
/CLAUDE.md          /404.html  404!
/*.md               /404.html  404!
/design-system/*    /404.html  404!
/plans/*            /404.html  404!
/artifacts/*        /404.html  404!
/mockups/*          /404.html  404!
/screenshots/*      /404.html  404!
/attached_assets/*  /404.html  404!
/undefined/*        /404.html  404!
/.claude/*          /404.html  404!
/skills-lock.json   /404.html  404!

